  "releaseNotes": "v3.1.0\n\n* FEATURE: Original set of Keccak hash algorithms implemented.\n\nv3.0.1\n\n* FIX: Improper padding for specific lengths that supplements to almost block size (minus 8 byte)\n\nv3.0.0\n\n* FEATURE: SHA3 Implemented\n\nv2.0.0\n\n* Backport to .Net Standard 2.0 to support all major .Net platforms that includes Mono, Xamarin, Unity, UWP.\n* .Net Standard 2.1 and .Net 6.0 also included in NuGet package now.\n\nv1.1.0\n\n* BlockHashAlgorithm migrated to Span/ReadOnlySpan interfaces to improve general performance,\n* Set of optimizations for MD5, SHA family\n\nv1.0.0\n\nLibrary modernization: Migrate to .Net Core, Add benchmarks, tests.\n\nBeta2\n\nRelease back from 2009 (Sourceforge)",
